---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="terms-container">
    <div class="terms-content">
      <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>

      <div class="last-updated">Last updated: June 2025</div>

      <div class="intro">
        <p>
          Welcome to LinguaLoop, a mobile application developed by LinguaTech
          ("we", "us", or "our"). These Terms and Conditions ("Terms") govern
          your use of the LinguaLoop mobile application and associated services
          (collectively, the "App"). By accessing or using the App, you agree to
          these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the App.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>1. Purpose</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms define the rights and obligations between LinguaTech and
          users ("you") regarding the use of the LinguaLoop language learning
          app and its services across mobile platforms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>2. Definitions</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>App:</strong> The LinguaLoop application and its related services.
        </p>
        <p><strong>User:</strong> Any person who accesses or uses the App.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Account:</strong> The profile and credentials used to access the
          App.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Content:</strong> All exercises, features, and media provided by
          the App. This includes embedded YouTube videos, which remain the intellectual
          property of their respective creators.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Subscription:</strong> A paid plan that grants access to premium
          features within the App.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>User Content:</strong> Any data or media submitted by users within
          the App.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>3. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By using the App, you accept these Terms and our Privacy Policy. If
          you do not agree, you must discontinue use immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>4. Interpretation of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          If any conflict arises between these Terms and specific feature or
          promotion terms, the latter shall prevail. Matters not covered will
          follow applicable law and standard business practice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>5. Account Registration and Use</h2>
        <p>
          To use the App, you are required to create an account. Registration is
          necessary to access the features and content offered within
          LinguaLoop. You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete
          information and to maintain its accuracy. We reserve the right to
          suspend or terminate your access for violations of these Terms or
          fraudulent activity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>6. Account Security</h2>
        <p>
          You are responsible for keeping your login credentials confidential.
          If you believe your account has been compromised, notify us at
          contact@linguatech.app. We are not responsible for losses from
          unauthorized use unless due to our negligence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>7. Service Features</h2>
        <p>LinguaLoop provides:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Dictation exercises and comprehension quizzes using video content
          </li>
          <li>Progress tracking and learning recommendations</li>
          <li>Language practice content (currently English and Spanish)</li>
          <li>
            Access to a limited number of exercises per day for free users; full
            content access is available to subscribers
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We may modify features or the availability of the App at any time
          without liability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>8. Service Modifications</h2>
        <p>
          We may update, suspend, or discontinue features for technical,
          operational, or business reasons. No compensation is owed for such
          modifications unless otherwise stated.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>9. Notifications</h2>
        <p>
          We may send you notices via the App, email, or website. You are
          responsible for keeping your contact information current. We are not
          liable for missed notices due to outdated information.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>10. Temporary Interruptions</h2>
        <p>
          We may interrupt access for maintenance or emergencies. When feasible,
          we will notify you in advance. We are not liable for losses during
          such downtime.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>11. Termination by User</h2>
        <p>
          You may stop using the App or request account deletion at any time.
          Deleting your account will remove all associated data, which cannot be
          recovered.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>12. Termination by LinguaTech</h2>
        <p>We may suspend or terminate your access without notice if you:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Violate these Terms or laws</li>
          <li>Use the App fraudulently or abusively</li>
          <li>Interfere with or disrupt the App or other users</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>13. Advertising and Third-Party Content</h2>
        <p>
          LinguaLoop may display advertising or content provided by third
          parties. We do not endorse, control, or take responsibility for the
          accuracy, reliability, or availability of third-party services or
          materials accessed through the App.
        </p>
        <p>
          The App uses embedded videos from YouTube, which are streamed through
          the official YouTube embedded player in compliance with YouTube's API
          Services Terms. LinguaLoop does not download, store, or alter any
          video content from YouTube. All intellectual property rights to such
          content remain with their respective creators.
        </p>
        <p>By using LinguaLoop, you acknowledge and agree to be bound by:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube Terms of Service</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          LinguaTech is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by
          YouTube or Google LLC. The use of YouTube content within the App is
          solely for educational purposes and adheres to all applicable API
          usage policies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>14. Our Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>
          We will provide the App in a secure, stable, and reliable manner. We
          take data protection seriously and follow our Privacy Policy. We may
          respond to support inquiries or complaints at our discretion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>15. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Reproduce or distribute App content</li>
          <li>Harass or defame others</li>
          <li>Scrape, reverse-engineer, or use the App via bots</li>
          <li>Submit unlawful, offensive, or infringing content</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>16. User-Generated Content</h2>
        <p>
          You may create or submit content within the App (e.g., recordings,
          feedback). You retain ownership but grant us a license to use such
          content for improvement or promotional purposes. We may moderate or
          remove content that violates these Terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>17. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All App content and branding are owned by LinguaTech or its licensors.
          You may not reuse any part of the App without our written permission.
          YouTube content is owned by its original creators and is used in
          compliance with YouTube's API Services Terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>18. Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          We provide the App "as is." We do not guarantee uninterrupted service,
          accuracy, or availability. We are not responsible for losses from
          downtime, user content, or third-party content.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>19. Subscriptions and Payments</h2>
        <p>
          All subscription transactions are processed by Apple through your App Store
          account. You are responsible for any taxes or fees that may apply in your
          jurisdiction.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>
            Subscriptions renew automatically for the same period and price unless
            cancelled at least 24&nbsp;hours before the end of the current period via
            your Apple&nbsp;ID settings.
          </strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          By confirming a subscription, you authorize Apple to charge the applicable
          fee to the payment method associated with your Apple&nbsp;ID.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>20. Right of Withdrawal</h2>
        <p>
          If you reside in the European Economic Area (EEA) or the United Kingdom,
          you have <strong>14&nbsp;days from the purchase date</strong> to withdraw
          from your subscription without giving any reason.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can exercise this right by visiting Apple’s
          <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            “Report a Problem”
          </a>
          page or by contacting Apple Support directly. All refunds are processed
          exclusively by Apple; LinguaLoop cannot override Apple’s refund decisions.
        </p>
        <p>
          Users outside the EEA/UK may still request a refund through the same Apple
          channels, subject to Apple’s regional policies.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>21. Mistaken Payments</h2>
        <p>
          For mistaken or duplicate payments, contact Apple. If LinguaTech
          processes a refund (e.g., for promotional credits), we may deduct
          applicable transaction fees.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>22. Damages and Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Each party is responsible for damages caused by breaches of these
          Terms if intentional or negligent. Our liability is limited to the
          fullest extent permitted by law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>23. Service Termination</h2>
        <p>
          We may shut down the App permanently with 30 days' notice. Features
          may be restricted during the transition.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>24. Governing Law and Jurisdiction</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Argentina. Any
          disputes shall be resolved by the courts of Buenos Aires, Argentina.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>25. Data Protection</h2>
        <p>
          We process personal data in accordance with our <a
            href="/lingualoop/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a
          >. By using the App, you consent to our handling of your information
          as described there.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section" id="contact-us">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or concerns about these Terms, please contact us:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Email:</strong>
            <a href="mailto:support@linguatech.com">support@linguatech.com</a
            ><br />
            <em
              >We usually reply within <strong
                >24 hours (Monday – Friday)</strong
              >.</em
            >
          </li>

          <li>
            <strong>Phone:</strong> +54&nbsp;11&nbsp;6283-1134<br />
            <em>(Mon–Fri 09:00–17:00 ART / 12:00–20:00 UTC)</em>
          </li>

          <li>
            <strong>Postal address:</strong><br />
            Santa Marta 1906, Buenos Aires, C1650<br />
            Argentina
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .terms-content {
    text-align: left;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .last-updated {
    text-align: center;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .intro {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .terms-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .terms-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .terms-section ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .terms-section strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .contact-section {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .contact-info {
    background: #f0f9ff;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-info p {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-info strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
  }

  a {
    color: #3b82f6;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .terms-container {
      margin: 1rem;
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .terms-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
